# Gendy3

- _Gendy3(ampdist=1, durdist=1, adparam=1.0, ddparam=1.0, freq=440, ampscale=0.5, durscale=0.5, initCPs=12, knum=initCPs)_

Dynamic stochastic synthesis generator.
This variant of GenDyn normalises the durations in each period to force oscillation at the desired pitch.

* * *

See also: Gendy1

Guides: Unit Generators
